        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#fafafa"
            }
          },
          "_name": "header3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Align\" name=\"contentAlign\">\n            <option value>Left</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-center\" selected>Center</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-end\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background11.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#00245c\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"align-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row {{contentAlign}}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Building a website</b></h1>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubitle\"><b>What is ProNail Complex?</b></h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">For fast prototyping and small customers' projects.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-success\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Free Download!</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tB83YwBUMj",
          "_anchor": "header3-1l",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><br></div><div>ProNail Complex is a specialized topical nail-care spray developed for people who want to improve the appearance and condition of their toenails. Many individuals experience nail problems such as brittleness, dryness, rough surfaces, discoloration, and changes in nail texture. These concerns can affect everyday confidence and make people uncomfortable wearing open footwear. ProNail Complex is promoted as a convenient option for supporting regular nail care through direct application. Its formula combines different oils and other ingredients selected for their moisturizing, conditioning, and protective properties. Rather than adding another complicated step to personal care, this spray provides a straightforward way to care for the nails and surrounding skin at home.</div><div><br></div><div>One of the main purposes of ProNail Complex is to support the overall appearance of toenails. Healthy-looking nails require regular attention, moisture, cleanliness, and protection from everyday environmental factors. When nails become excessively dry or brittle, they may look rough and become more vulnerable to splitting and breakage. ProNail Complex is designed to provide topical care by delivering its ingredients directly to the nail surface and nearby skin. Its advertised botanical formula includes ingredients such as tea tree oil, aloe vera, and nourishing plant oils. These ingredients are commonly used in personal-care products for their conditioning properties. Regular nail-care habits alongside appropriate product use can help maintain a cleaner and more comfortable nail environment.</div><div><br></div><div>Another important aspect of ProNail Complex is its focus on nail and surrounding skin care. The skin around toenails can become dry, rough, or uncomfortable, especially when exposed to frequent washing, tight footwear, and environmental stress. A suitable moisturizing routine can help maintain softer skin and improve the overall appearance of the feet. ProNail Complex is marketed as a convenient mist that can be applied to the affected nail areas without using heavy creams or complicated application methods. Its ingredients are intended to provide moisture and conditioning support. This makes it an option for individuals who want to include targeted nail care in their everyday grooming and personal hygiene routine.</div><div><br></div><div>ProNail Complex is also promoted for individuals concerned about nail discoloration and fungal-related nail problems. Toenail discoloration can have several causes, including fungal infections, injuries, skin conditions, and other health-related factors. The product's advertised formula contains ingredients associated with topical cleansing and antifungal research, including tea tree oil and undecylenic acid on certain product listings. However, the presence of these ingredients does not establish that the complete formula can cure a fungal infection. Anyone experiencing persistent discoloration, thickening, pain, or changes in nail shape should seek a professional assessment. Understanding the underlying cause is important before choosing an appropriate nail-care approach.</div><div><br></div><div>Overall, ProNail Complex is positioned as an easy-to-use nail-care spray for people who want to give their toenails and surrounding skin regular attention. Its direct application format makes it convenient to incorporate into a morning or evening routine. The formula is promoted around several personal-care goals, including moisture, nail conditioning, improved appearance, and everyday protection. It may appeal to people who prefer topical products containing botanical oils rather than complicated nail-care systems. However, results can vary depending on individual nail conditions, product consistency, and the underlying cause of any nail problem. A balanced approach that includes proper hygiene, suitable footwear, and professional guidance when needed remains important.</div><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
