          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><b>1. Direct Nail Application:</b>&nbsp;ProNail Complex is designed to work through direct application to the toenails and surrounding skin. Its spray format allows users to apply the formula to specific areas that need additional attention. Unlike products that must be swallowed, a topical spray is applied externally as part of a regular personal-care routine. The ingredients listed for the formula include various oils and skin-conditioning compounds intended to support the appearance and comfort of the nail area. By applying the product consistently according to its label directions, users can make nail care a regular habit. Clean and dry nails provide a suitable starting point for applying most topical nail-care products.</div><div><br></div><div><b>2. Moisture and Conditioning Support:</b>&nbsp;The moisturizing ingredients in ProNail Complex are intended to help maintain the condition of the nails and surrounding skin. Dryness can make the nail area look rough and can contribute to uncomfortable skin around the cuticles. Ingredients such as mineral oil, sweet almond oil, and jojoba oil are commonly used in personal-care formulations because they help condition the skin and reduce moisture loss. When incorporated into a topical nail-care product, these ingredients can help soften dry areas and improve the overall feel of the skin. Maintaining moisture is an important part of everyday nail care, especially for people who frequently experience dryness or rough cuticles.</div><div><br></div><div><b>3.Botanical Nail Care:</b>&nbsp;ProNail Complex is promoted with a blend of botanical ingredients that are commonly found in skin and personal-care products. Tea tree oil, lavender oil, and lemongrass oil are examples of plant-derived ingredients associated with topical cleansing and skin-care applications. Different botanical oils have different properties, and their effects depend on their concentration, formulation, and method of application. The purpose of including these ingredients is to provide targeted care for the nail surface and surrounding skin. Regular application may support a well-maintained appearance, although botanical ingredients should not automatically be considered replacements for medically approved treatments when an infection or another nail condition is present.</div><div><br></div><div><b>4.Supporting a Cleaner Nail Environment: </b>Keeping the nails clean is an important part of maintaining their overall condition. Moisture, trapped debris, poorly fitting footwear, and inadequate nail hygiene can contribute to uncomfortable foot conditions. ProNail Complex is marketed as a topical product intended to support nail cleanliness and everyday care. Certain listed ingredients, including tea tree oil and undecylenic acid, are associated with antifungal applications. However, their presence in a cosmetic or nail-care formula does not prove that the finished product effectively treats fungal infections. A consistent hygiene routine, clean socks, breathable shoes, and properly maintained nail tools can all contribute to a healthier nail-care environment.</div><div><br></div><div><b>5.Consistent Personal-Care Routine: </b>Like most nail-care products, ProNail Complex is intended to be used consistently rather than occasionally. Nail appearance changes gradually because toenails grow slowly, and improvements in newly growing nail tissue may take considerable time to become visible. Regular application according to the product label allows users to maintain a consistent personal-care routine. It is also important to avoid habits that may damage the nails, including cutting them too aggressively or wearing shoes that place excessive pressure on the toes. Combining appropriate product use with basic nail hygiene can help maintain better-looking nails. Individual experiences will vary, and persistent nail problems deserve professional attention.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div><b>\n</b></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content4-2n",
          "_isUserblock": true,
