        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><b><br></b></div><ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthier-Looking Toenails: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">One of the main advertised benefits of ProNail Complex is its focus on maintaining healthier-looking toenails. Nails can become rough, dull, brittle, or uneven because of everyday wear, dryness, and other factors. ProNail Complex is designed to provide topical conditioning through a blend of botanical oils and other personal-care ingredients. Its direct application method makes it convenient to care for the nail surface and surrounding areas. With regular nail hygiene and appropriate moisturizing care, users can work toward maintaining a smoother and more attractive nail appearance. Healthy-looking nails are also easier to maintain when combined with proper trimming and suitable footwear.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Helps Maintain Nail Moisture:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Dryness is a common concern affecting both toenails and the skin around them. When the surrounding skin loses moisture, it may become rough, flaky, or uncomfortable. ProNail Complex features moisturizing ingredients such as mineral oil and sweet almond oil on its advertised ingredient lists. These ingredients are commonly used in topical personal-care products to condition the skin and help reduce moisture loss. Maintaining adequate moisture can make the nail area feel softer and improve its overall appearance. Adding a suitable moisturizing product to a regular foot-care routine may be particularly useful for people who frequently experience dry skin around their toenails.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Provides Botanical Nail-Care Support: </b>ProNail Complex is promoted with several botanical ingredients that are commonly used in personal-care formulations. Tea tree oil, lavender oil, and aloe vera are examples of ingredients associated with topical skin-care applications. These ingredients are included to provide conditioning and general nail-care support. Different botanical ingredients have different properties, and their effectiveness depends on the complete formulation and concentration. A botanical-based nail-care routine may appeal to individuals who prefer products featuring plant-derived ingredients. However, natural ingredients are not automatically suitable for everyone, and people with sensitive skin should review the ingredient list and check for possible irritation before regular application.</span></li><li><b>Supports the Appearance of Dry, Rough Cuticles: </b>The condition of the skin surrounding the nails is an important part of overall foot care. Dry cuticles and rough skin can make toenails appear less well-maintained, even when the nail surface itself is relatively healthy. ProNail Complex includes ingredients such as aloe vera, sweet almond oil, and other conditioning oils on certain advertised product listings. These ingredients are commonly used in topical products to support skin moisture and softness. Regularly caring for the surrounding skin can help improve the overall appearance of the feet. Gentle cleaning, avoiding aggressive cuticle removal, and using suitable moisturizing products are also helpful habits.</li><li><b>Helps Maintain a Cleaner Nail-Care Routine: </b>Good nail hygiene plays an important role in maintaining comfortable and healthy-looking feet. Dirt, trapped moisture, and poorly maintained footwear can contribute to different foot and nail concerns. ProNail Complex offers a convenient spray format that can be incorporated into an everyday nail-care routine. Its advertised botanical ingredients are selected to support topical nail and skin care. Alongside appropriate product use, people should keep their feet clean and dry, change socks regularly, and avoid sharing nail clippers or other personal grooming tools. These simple habits help maintain a cleaner environment around the nails and support better overall foot hygiene.</li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Better-Looking Nail Texture: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Uneven, rough, and brittle-looking nails can make regular grooming more challenging. ProNail Complex is marketed as a topical nail-care formula intended to support the appearance and condition of the nail surface. Its moisturizing and conditioning ingredients may help improve the feel of dry nail areas and surrounding skin. Consistent nail maintenance is equally important because toenails are exposed to friction, pressure, and everyday environmental stress. Wearing comfortable footwear, trimming nails properly, and avoiding unnecessary nail damage can help maintain a smoother appearance. ProNail Complex can be considered part of this broader personal-care approach rather than a guaranteed solution for every nail concern</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">.</span></li></ul><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
